---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact TrekkersQuest"><section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">SAY HELLO</span><h1>Let’s talk trails.</h1><p>Have a question or a correction? Use the demo form below. No message is sent without a real submission integration.</p></section><section class="section"><form class="contact-form" id="contact"><label>Name<input class="form-control" name="name" required autocomplete="name" /></label><label>Email<input class="form-control" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" /></label><label>Subject<input class="form-control" name="subject" /></label><label>Message<textarea class="form-control" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea></label><button class="button" type="submit">Prepare message</button><p id="feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form><p class="notice">Demo mode: form details stay in your browser and are not transmitted. Add a verified business email or service endpoint before launch.</p></section><script is:inline>document.querySelector('#contact').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();if(!e.currentTarget.reportValidity())return;document.querySelector('#feedback').textContent='Demo mode: your message has been prepared in this browser only. Nothing was sent.';e.currentTarget.reset()})</script></Layout>
